WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:06.993
Open Interaction Center, Management, Extensions.

00:00:06.993 --> 00:00:09.943
The list is empty until you add one.

00:00:09.943 --> 00:00:11.770
Click Add extension.

00:00:12.234 --> 00:00:16.747
Display name is what a colleague sees when this extension calls them.

00:00:16.747 --> 00:00:19.334
Leave it empty to show the user name.

00:00:19.788 --> 00:00:24.559
Extension number is the number colleagues dial, such as 1001.

00:00:24.559 --> 00:00:26.268
It must be unique.

00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:29.707
User is the person the extension rings.

00:00:29.707 --> 00:00:34.020
Type to search the enabled users, pick one, and click Save.

00:00:34.471 --> 00:00:37.678
Add an extension for each person who takes calls.

00:00:37.678 --> 00:00:41.934
The list shows each number, its display name and the user it rings,

00:00:41.934 --> 00:00:44.791
and you can search it by number or by name.

00:00:45.242 --> 00:00:48.633
Every saved extension can be dialed straight away.

00:00:48.633 --> 00:00:51.722
To stop one ringing, delete it from the list.

